      "name": "global_continuation_uncertainty",
      "rationale": "Adds greedy continuation value and penalizes the cover-versus-greedy gap per surviving vertex, favoring more tightly estimated continuations. Both algorithms reach the full root-conditioned residual; their CPU cost can be substantial and the gap supplies only a ranking cue.",
